		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Construct made from wicker and twine. Constantly aflame but never consumed by fire. Hollow, body forms a cage. Animate pyre.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 19, <strong>HP</strong> 35, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +5 (1d10 + grab) and 1 imprison or 1 cinder (far) +4 (1d10), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Construct</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources. Healed by fire, double damage from cold.</p><p></p><p><strong>Grab</strong>. STR 15+ or held. STR 15+ on turn to break free.</p><p></p><p><strong>Imprison</strong>. Place grabbed target inside cage-body, 2d6 damage per round. Cage is destroyed if 10 damage in one round is dealt to interior of wickerman.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
